---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Narrow Digital Marketing — Local marketing for small businesses"
description: "Local SEO, websites and Google Ads for small businesses in Yucaipa, Banning and the Inland Empire. Built and maintained by Pedro Ruiz."
---

{# ==========================================================================
   HOME
   Sections: hero -> services teaser -> about teaser -> work -> CTA
   ========================================================================== #}

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap" data-reveal-group>

    {# The logo lockup, exported from your original file. Height is set in CSS. #}
    <div class="hero__logo reveal">
      <img src="/assets/img/logo-lockup.svg" alt="Narrow Digital Marketing" width="360" height="138">
    </div>

    <!--
      TAGLINE — swap freely, keep it under about 8 words. Alternatives:
        "Marketing that makes the phone ring."
        "Local marketing, done properly."
        "The work behind getting found."
    -->
    <h1 class="hero__title reveal">
      Get found by the people already looking<span class="diamond" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </h1>

    <div class="hero__meta reveal">
      <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start a project</a>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/work/">See the work <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>

    <a class="hero__scroll" href="#what-i-do">Scroll</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHAT I DO (teaser — pulls the first 3 from src/_data/services.json) ============ -->
<section class="section section--tight" id="what-i-do">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">01 &mdash; What I do</span>
      <h2>Marketing built for businesses that run on phone calls</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="rows" data-reveal-group>
      {% for s in services.items %}
        {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}{# change 3 to show more or fewer on the homepage #}
          <a class="row reveal" href="/services/#{{ s.slug }}">
            <span class="row__num">{{ s.num }}</span>
            <span class="row__title">{{ s.title | safe }}</span>
            <span class="row__body">{{ s.summary }}</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4 reveal">
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/services/">All services <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ABOUT TEASER ============ -->
<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split split--even" data-reveal-group>

      <!--
        ============================================================
        YOUR PHOTO — homepage teaser. Same file as the About page.
        Swap it in both places if you change it.
        ============================================================
      -->
      <div class="about__photo reveal">
        <img src="/assets/img/about-photo.jpg"
             srcset="/assets/img/about-photo-600.jpg 600w, /assets/img/about-photo-900.jpg 900w, /assets/img/about-photo.jpg 1200w"
             sizes="(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 92vw"
             alt="Portrait of Pedro Ruiz, founder of Narrow Digital Marketing"
             width="1200" height="1500" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <div class="about__body reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">02 &mdash; About</span>
        <h2>I build for the businesses I grew up around</h2>

        <p>
          I&rsquo;m Pedro. I&rsquo;m twenty, I live in Yucaipa, and my dad runs a landscaping
          business &mdash; so I know what a slow month feels like from the inside. I work with
          small businesses in the Inland Empire, one at a time.
        </p>

        <p><a class="link-arrow" href="/about/">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SELECTED WORK ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">03 &mdash; Selected work</span>
      <h2>One project at a time, done properly</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="work-list" data-reveal-group>
      {# Shows the most recent case study from /src/work/. Add a file there and it appears here. #}
      {% for item in collections.work | reverse %}
        {% if loop.index0 < 1 %}
          <a class="work-card reveal" href="{{ item.url }}">
            <div class="work-card__media">
              <img src="{{ item.data.cover }}"
                   srcset="/assets/img/banning-glass-storefront-800.jpg 800w, /assets/img/banning-glass-storefront.jpg 1600w"
                   sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 1200px, 92vw"
                   alt="{{ item.data.coverAlt }}" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="work-card__meta">
              <span class="work-card__title">{{ item.data.client }}</span>
              <span class="work-card__tag">{{ item.data.tag }}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4 reveal">
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/work/">All work <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
